{"articleNo":"127797","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=127797&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015 OECD 영문에세이 경진대회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.04.20","hit":"2347","attachments":[{"name":"oecd 에세이 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=127797&attachNo=73525"},{"name":"oecd 자소서 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=127797&attachNo=73689"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외교부는 우리나라 청년들의 경제협력개발기구</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(OECD) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">등 국제경제기구에서 논의되는 경제 이슈에 대한 이해를 제고하고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></font></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">청년들의 글로벌 무대 진출을 지원하고자 아래와 같이 영문에세이 경진대회를 개최할 예정입니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에세이 주제 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아래 주제 중 하나를 선정하여 영문으로 작성</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- OECD </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가입 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주년을 맞아</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, OECD </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">내 변화하는 한국의 역할</span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">유엔주도의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Post-2015 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개발체제 출범 관련 등 변화하는 글로벌 환경속에서의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">OECD </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">역할은</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">? </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응모기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">16</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">~5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">접수처 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: oecdessaycontest@gmail.com(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이메일로만 접수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제출서류 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">자기소개서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">붙임양식</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">와 영문에세이</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분량 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">영어단어기준 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1,000</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">단어 내외</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응모대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; L